<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.2 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.2 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for January rose 3.2 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In December 1996, the index grew by 3.3 percent.</p>
</text>
